
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>StudySphere | Find Your Study Space</title>
  <meta name="description" content="StudySphere helps students discover and reserve campus study rooms.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <header class="navbar">
    <a href="/" class="brand">
      <span class="brand-icon">S</span>
      <span>StudySphere</span>
    </a>

    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="/reservations">Reservations</a>
    </nav>

    <a href="/reservations/new" class="nav-button">Book a Room</a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">YOUR CAMPUS. YOUR SPACE.</span>

        <h1>Find your focus.<br><span>Reserve your space.</span></h1>

        <p>
          Discover a better way to study. Find and reserve campus
          study rooms in one simple place, so you can focus on what matters.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/reservations/new" class="primary-button">Reserve a Room →</a>
          <a href="#about" class="secondary-button">Learn More</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-note">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          A smarter way to study on campus
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-top">
            <span>STUDYSPACE</span>
            <span class="available">● AVAILABLE</span>
          </div>

          <div class="room-icon">⌂</div>
          <h2>Your next study session starts here.</h2>
          <p>Choose a room. Pick a time. Get focused.</p>

          <div class="visual-details">
            <span>QUIET STUDY ROOMS</span>
            <span>FLEXIBLE BOOKINGS</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card">
          <span class="floating-icon">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Simple booking</strong>
            <small>Less searching, more studying.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="about">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">MADE FOR STUDENTS</span>
        <h2>Everything you need to study better.</h2>
        <p>Keep your campus study sessions organized and stress-free.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-number">01</span>
          <h3>Find a Space</h3>
          <p>Explore study room options and choose a space that suits your needs.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-number">02</span>
          <h3>Book Your Time</h3>
          <p>Submit your reservation details through a straightforward booking process.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-number">03</span>
          <h3>Stay Organized</h3>
          <p>Keep track of your study room reservations from one dashboard.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing">
      <span class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR SUCCESS</span>
      <h2>Your next productive session is one reservation away.</h2>
      <a href="/reservations/new" class="primary-button">Get Started →</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <a href="/" class="brand">
      <span class="brand-icon">S</span>
      <span>StudySphere</span>
    </a>
    <p>Designed for students, built for better study sessions.</p>
    <span>© 2026 StudySphere</span>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
